WEBVTT

00:00:03.034 --> 00:00:05.078
-[laughter]
-[Snotlout] This is perfect.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.581
So great.

00:00:07.664 --> 00:00:08.915
Not a word.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:11.960
[purring]

00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:14.713
Yes, yes. But where did they go?

00:00:14.796 --> 00:00:16.757
[sighs] I have to explain this.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.260
Night Furies can't survive in the cold,
so they haven't gone north.

00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:22.804
They're trying to put distance
between themselves

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:24.890
and enemies to the east and south.

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:29.519
And Night Furies cannot fly
long distances without rest.

00:00:31.021 --> 00:00:33.565
Their flight path must include stops.

00:00:33.648 --> 00:00:34.858
Potty break!

00:00:37.235 --> 00:00:39.571
[Grimmel] Therefore, they've gone...

00:00:41.823 --> 00:00:44.326
They can only have gone...

00:00:46.495 --> 00:00:48.288
Does anyone want to take a guess?

00:00:49.831 --> 00:00:50.957
Anyone?

00:00:51.374 --> 00:00:53.126
[stutters mockingly]

00:00:53.752 --> 00:00:55.170
Ah, east!

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:56.671
West.

00:00:57.047 --> 00:00:58.048
Hmm?

00:00:58.131 --> 00:00:59.883
Simple, you see?

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:01.968
Oh, isn't this fun?

00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:04.054
Yes? No?

00:01:04.304 --> 00:01:05.514
[groans]

00:01:05.597 --> 00:01:08.058
-Yes. Yes.
-[groans]

00:01:08.141 --> 00:01:10.560
Where is your love of the hunt?

00:01:10.644 --> 00:01:12.896
I thought you were conquerors.

00:01:12.979 --> 00:01:15.190
You'll have your prize in time.

00:01:15.273 --> 00:01:19.486
Just allow me
a few more days to enjoy this.

00:01:20.153 --> 00:01:22.572
I have dearly missed it.

00:01:22.656 --> 00:01:23.698
[Hiccup] All right.

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:25.867
Looks like we're camping here for tonight.

00:01:25.951 --> 00:01:28.119
Well, thanks Thor for that!

00:01:28.203 --> 00:01:31.623
Yes! My own place. I plan to build a hut.

00:01:31.706 --> 00:01:33.208
Only for the bearded.

00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:35.126
Ruffnut, you gotta stay out.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:36.837
Chin whiskers don't count.

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:40.131
[Snotlout] I see a tower of manliness
in the shape of me.

00:01:40.215 --> 00:01:43.593
It's gonna be taller than Eret
with bigger muscles.

00:01:43.677 --> 00:01:44.845
Wha... What?

00:01:44.928 --> 00:01:45.929
Get outta my house!

00:01:46.012 --> 00:01:46.930
Hey!

00:01:47.055 --> 00:01:48.265
Is there a problem here?

00:01:48.348 --> 00:01:49.474
Yeah, there's a problem.

00:01:49.558 --> 00:01:51.685
Ever since you showed up,
you've been trying to upstage me.

00:01:51.768 --> 00:01:54.104
You're just so jealous. It's delusional.

00:01:54.187 --> 00:01:55.981
Yeah, delusion's a good word for it.

00:01:56.064 --> 00:01:57.315
Listen, son of Eret.

00:01:57.399 --> 00:01:59.985
When Hiccup blows it as chief,
I'm next in line.

00:02:00.068 --> 00:02:02.529
Number two,
'cause I'm clearly Valka's favorite.

00:02:02.612 --> 00:02:04.948
So, you better start
showing me some respect.

00:02:05.907 --> 00:02:07.784
[chuckles] Strange little man.

00:02:08.201 --> 00:02:09.452
Ah, don't mind him.

00:02:09.536 --> 00:02:13.123
It's not your fault
you have the body of a Norse god.

00:02:13.206 --> 00:02:15.041
I myself have the same problem.

00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:16.418
-[back cracks]
-[screams]

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:18.378
-[man 1] This one's mine!
-[man 2] This one's mine!

00:02:18.461 --> 00:02:20.839
Blacksmith's stall goes right here.

00:02:20.922 --> 00:02:21.923
Aah!

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:23.425
One, two,

00:02:23.508 --> 00:02:25.719
three, four, five. Where's... [gasps]

00:02:25.802 --> 00:02:26.970
[Hiccup] Uh, okay.

00:02:27.053 --> 00:02:29.389
Hold on, gang. I... I said make camp.

00:02:29.472 --> 00:02:30.473
Did you see them?

00:02:30.557 --> 00:02:32.559
Not build a new village.

00:02:32.642 --> 00:02:34.269
Who died and made you chief?

00:02:34.352 --> 00:02:35.395
[others groan]

00:02:35.478 --> 00:02:36.897
What? Ow!

00:02:37.105 --> 00:02:41.693
Granted, this place is very nice,
but it's not the Hidden World.

00:02:41.776 --> 00:02:44.779
We don't even know
if this Hidden World exists.

00:02:44.863 --> 00:02:46.781
Yeah. This place is real.

00:02:46.865 --> 00:02:47.866
[crowd] Yeah!

00:02:47.949 --> 00:02:52.329
Eh, there's nothing more stubborn
than a mob of tired, hungry Vikings.

00:02:52.412 --> 00:02:55.916
[sighs] Well, I guess this can work
as a base in the meantime.

00:02:56.416 --> 00:02:58.668
It's defensible. Hidden.

00:02:59.961 --> 00:03:01.671
All right. You can stay.

00:03:01.755 --> 00:03:03.298
Say hello to New Berk!

00:03:03.381 --> 00:03:05.175
-[all] Yeah!
-Let's get building, lads!

00:03:05.258 --> 00:03:07.677
Until Toothless and I
find the Hidden World.

00:03:07.761 --> 00:03:09.930
[crowd groans and boos]

00:03:10.639 --> 00:03:11.723
Now, about that voice.

00:03:11.806 --> 00:03:15.226
Can we lose the whole honking goose thing?

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:18.897
It's hard to imagine wedded bliss
with that going off every minute.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.315
[laughs]

00:03:20.732 --> 00:03:22.067
If you're going to continue west,

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:24.527
I should head back to make sure
we weren't followed.

00:03:24.611 --> 00:03:26.738
Great idea.
I'll go with you for protection.

00:03:26.821 --> 00:03:27.781
No!

00:03:28.156 --> 00:03:29.824
You're far too important here.

00:03:30.492 --> 00:03:31.493
Yeah.

00:03:33.161 --> 00:03:34.579
Just be careful.

00:03:34.663 --> 00:03:36.623
-[man 1] Look at this place! It's amazing!
-[man 2] That's a nice rock.

00:03:36.706 --> 00:03:37.707
What?

00:03:37.791 --> 00:03:41.378
This plan to hide us
from the rest of the world...

00:03:42.295 --> 00:03:46.758
Though... Though I wish it were possible,
I fear it can't last, Hiccup.

00:03:46.841 --> 00:03:49.469
I mean, you know I tried
to do the same for years.

00:03:50.595 --> 00:03:54.766
But greedy humans always find a way.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:56.601
I just...

00:03:57.185 --> 00:03:59.104
I only ask that you think about it.

00:04:02.691 --> 00:04:04.901
[Hiccup]
Do you still think I'm crazy or...

00:04:04.985 --> 00:04:09.489
Let's just say
this whole idea is very you.

00:04:09.572 --> 00:04:13.076
Well, thanks for supporting me last night.
It meant a lot.

00:04:13.243 --> 00:04:15.370
[chuckles] Don't thank me yet.

00:04:15.996 --> 00:04:17.747
I just hope you're right about this.

00:04:22.502 --> 00:04:25.505
-[people and dragons snoring]
-[crickets chirping]

00:04:35.932 --> 00:04:37.892
[grunts and snorts]

00:04:38.268 --> 00:04:40.437
Toothless! No, it's too early.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.855
[sniffing]

00:04:43.231 --> 00:04:44.232
[grunts]

00:04:50.864 --> 00:04:52.240
[grunts]

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.418
[grunts softly]

00:05:07.756 --> 00:05:10.550
[grunting happily and purring]

00:05:12.177 --> 00:05:13.845
-[yowls]
-[grunts]

00:05:13.928 --> 00:05:15.430
[purrs]

00:05:24.064 --> 00:05:25.231
[grunts]

00:05:29.694 --> 00:05:32.197
[both grunting softly]

00:05:36.534 --> 00:05:37.577
[groans]

00:05:44.793 --> 00:05:47.462
[both purring]

00:05:50.381 --> 00:05:51.382
[grunts]

00:05:52.675 --> 00:05:54.302
[yawns]

00:06:04.687 --> 00:06:06.064
[Light Fury calling]

00:06:08.858 --> 00:06:10.318
[screeches]

